    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.11">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 2.11</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">De dosseris cum gallinis I gallina telonei, et de uno dossero cum ovis V ova telonei, si veniant ad mercatum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">From hampers with hens, one hen [is given] as toll, and from one hamper of eggs, five eggs as toll, if they come to the market.</ab>
